                                "sense_id": "8522ef2b-df4f-3fe4-9b87-162deac8f90a",
                                "text": "Like many people, in the pandemic, my life digitized. My work shifted online; my friendships retreated onto FaceTime and WhatsApp; I used a dating app for the first time; I started doing online yoga."
